    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/75",
      "text": "Medical standards for licensing - blackouts of uncertain nature",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        68.0315,
        68.5175999999999,
        358.81519999999983,
        77.26245687022902
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 68.0315,
          "t": 773.3724000000001,
          "r": 358.81519999999983,
          "b": 764.627543129771,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          63
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/76",
      "text": "Health professionals should familiarise themselves with the information in this chapter and the tabulated standards before assessing a person's fitness to drive.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        68.0314,
        87.6771,
        486.2199999999998,
        106.4551370713624
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 68.0314,
          "t": 754.2129,
          "r": 486.2199999999998,
          "b": 735.4348629286376,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          161
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/77",
      "text": "Blackouts - episode(s) or impaired consciousness - of uncertain nature A person should not drive for 6 months following a single blackout of undetermined nature.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        68.0315,
        225.01049999999998,
        126.77449999999999,
        292.98853707136243
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 68.0315,
          "t": 616.8795,
          "r": 126.77449999999999,
          "b": 548.9014629286376,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          70
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/77",
      "text": "Blackouts - episode(s) or impaired consciousness - of uncertain nature A person should not drive for 6 months following a single blackout of undetermined nature.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        225.01049999999998,
        313.17259999999993,
        254.58863707136243
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 616.8795,
          "r": 313.17259999999993,
          "b": 587.3013629286376,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          71,
          161
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/78",
      "text": "A person should not drive for 12 months following two or more blackouts of undetermined nature separated by a 24hour period.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        263.07989999999995,
        326.19739999999996,
        304.6579370713624
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 578.8101,
          "r": 326.19739999999996,
          "b": 537.2320629286376,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          124
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/79",
      "text": "A person is not fit to hold an unconditional licence:",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        314.3492,
        330.41619999999995,
        334.32723707136233
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 527.5408,
          "r": 330.41619999999995,
          "b": 507.56276292863765,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          53
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/80",
      "text": "if the person has experienced blackouts that cannot be diagnosed as syncope, seizure or another condition.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        344.0185,
        330.54030000000023,
        375.71279935125114
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 497.87149999999997,
          "r": 330.54030000000023,
          "b": 466.17720064874885,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          108
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/81",
      "text": "If there has been a single blackout or more than one blackout within a 24-hour period, a conditional licence may be considered by the driver licensing authority subject to at least annual review, taking into account information provided by the treating doctor as to whether the following criterion is met:",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        385.6878,
        332.7653999999999,
        465.3820993512511
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 456.2022,
          "r": 332.7653999999999,
          "b": 376.5079006487489,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          305
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/82",
      "text": "there have been no further blackouts for at least 6 months.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        475.3571,
        331.7283000000003,
        495.33513707136234
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 366.5329,
          "r": 331.7283000000003,
          "b": 346.55486292863765,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          61
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/83",
      "text": "If there have been two or more blackouts separated by at least 24 hours, a conditional licence may be considered by the driver licensing authority subject to at least annual review, taking into account information provided by the treating doctor as to whether the following criterion is met:",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        505.0264,
        332.7653999999999,
        584.7206993512511
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
        "page_no": 3,
        "bbox": {
          "l": 163.9094,
          "t": 336.86359999999996,
          "r": 332.7653999999999,
          "b": 257.16930064874884,
          "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
        },
        "charspan": [
          0,
          291
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "native_ref": "#/texts/84",
      "text": "there have been no further blackouts for at least 12 months.",
      "bbox_top_left": [
        163.9094,
        594.6957,
        331.7283000000003,
        614.6737370713623
      ],
      "native_provenance": {
